<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA XI V WEST INDIES SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA XI V WEST INDIES SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART, Australia 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play</p>
<p>scoreboard on the first day of the four-day tour match between</p>
<p>an Australia XI and West Indies at Bellerive Oval on Friday.</p>
<p>Australia XI first innings</p>
<p> M.Hayden not out			  143</p>
<p> M.Elliot not out			  153</p>
<p> Extras (lb-2 nb-9)			 20</p>
<p> Total (for no wicket)		   316</p>
<p>To bat: G.Blewett, S.Law (captain), M.Bevan, D.Lehmann,</p>
<p>A.Gilchrist, B.Hogg, A.Bichel, A.Stuart, J.Gillespie.</p>
<p>Bowling: Bishop 18-1-52-0 (nb-2), McLean 20-2-87-0 (nb-12),</p>
<p>Hooper 21-2-73-0 (nb-4), Thompson 16-1-67-0, Adams 12-0-35-0.</p>
<p>Overs: 87</p>
<p>Note: No-balls worth two runs. West Indies bowled nine</p>
<p>no-balls.</p>
</text>
